        "text": "-metabolizers}, the small intestine...\n```\n*   **The `~` (tilde):** This"
      }, {
        "text": " is a \"non-breaking space.\" It ensures that \"Table\" and \"1\" never get split across two different lines."
      }, {
        "text": "\n\n### 2. The \"Smart\" Way (Using `cleveref`)\nIf you want LaTeX to automatically type"
